, 1132, 764, 101], "min_conf": 5.052788}, {"text": "the love which springs from ad-", "box": [1316, 1189, 762, 56], "min_conf": 90.523643}, {"text": "miration and veneration, and which", "box": [1315, 1244, 764, 46], "min_conf": 91.33165}, {"text": "chooses its object with decision of", "box": [1317, 1296, 773, 53], "min_conf": 96.277565}, {"text": "will, and devotes a self-denying and", "box": [1315, 1346, 768, 101], "min_conf": 62.874878}, {"text": "compassionate devotion to it. Love", "box": [1316, 1404, 763, 52], "min_conf": 58.639603}, {"text": "in its fullest conceivable form.", "box": [1315, 1455, 694, 42], "min_conf": 96.30751}, {"text": "2. φιλανθρωπία, philanthropy, love of", "box": [1206, 1524, 872, 56], "min_conf": 93.149307}, {"text": "man, (see above.)", "box": [1313, 1579, 368, 51], "min_conf": 96.464203}, {"text": "1. Matt. xxiv. 12, 1. Phil. i. 9, 17.", "box": [1205, 1656, 714, 35], "min_conf": 76.982315}, {"text": "1. Luke xi. 48. 1. — ii. 1,2.", "box": [1206, 1690, 692, 35], "min_conf": 50.66465}, {"text": "1. John v. 42. 1. Col. 1. 4, 8.", "box": [1206, 1707, 680, 61], "min_conf": 30.998619}, {"text": "1, —— xiii. 35. 1. — ii. 2.", "box": [1206, 1740, 652, 63], "min_conf": 0.0}, {"text": "1. —— xv. 9, 10twiee, 18, | 1. 1 Thea. i. 8.", "box": [1207, 1786, 691, 44], "min_conf": 34.927032}, {"text": "1, — xvii. 26, 1, —— iff. 12. .", "box": [1206, 1808, 984, 62], "min_conf": 35.954834}, {"text": "1. Rom. ν. 5, 8. 1. — v. 8, 13.", "box": [1207, 1858, 701, 32], "min_conf": 68.787354}, {"text": "1, — viii. 35, 39. 1. 2 Thes. ii. 10,", "box": [1207, 1891, 720, 34], "min_conf": 83.134094}, {"text": "1, —— xil. 9. 1. — fii. 5.", "box": [1206, 1907, 663, 62], "min_conf": 45.916756}, {"text": "— —— 10, see Brother- | 1. 1 Tim. 1. 14.", "box": [1205, 1942, 697, 61], "min_conf": 63.532558}, {"text": "ly or Brethren. — — wi. 10, see Money.", "box": [1271, 1991, 805, 38], "min_conf": 86.348656}, {"text": "1, — xiii, 10 twice. 1, ——U.", "box": [1205, 2007, 657, 